When you have dealt with one, run: patchtacio ack <CVE ID>, for example: patchtacio ack CVE-2026-10006
Patchtacio then stops reminding you about it.
You get this alert because Fortinet FortiOS (FortiGate firewalls) is on your Patchtacio product list.
